exports[`security.habitat.redteam given: [case1] the guardian role installed via rhachet init when: [t5] the human joins a flag to its value with = then: it belays (exit 2) and names the spaced form 1`] = `
"🐈 belay that...

🧿 security.habitat.redteam
   ├─ fix: pass the value as its own word: --grain leak
